# ARCHITECTURE — chainiam-private-ai: add NEAR USDC payments next to RLUSD

Target repo: `<your-folder>\chainiam-private-ai`
Status of this document: design. Sections marked **VERIFIED** were read from the code or official docs. Sections marked **GATE** must be verified by the implementer before code is written (see §4).

