## 1. Goal and scope

**Goal:** a paid chat call can be paid either in RLUSD on the XRP Ledger (today) or in USDC on NEAR (new), chosen by `.env`. The masked-chat behaviour, gateway and models are unchanged.

**In scope:** paywall (verify + settle NEAR USDC), web page (NEAR wallet option), buyer scripts/rig (NEAR signer), payment log line for NEAR.

**Out of scope (later step):** TEE custody wallets (OutLayer). The signer interface in §5.4 is designed so the TEE signer replaces the dev signer with no change to payment code.

